    "semanticFinding": "Reader described a baton or club. Three-quarter foreshortening often hides the tube. This rates purpose-direction recognition only, not recognition of courier or delivery."
  },
  "physicalMethod": "Measure only the game GLB. Split the handle into geometric components by position connectivity, take the long rod and exclude both end standoffs. In the held hand count triangles with mean bone influence above 0.35 per digit that intersect the rod. Project the centroid of unique contact intersections per digit onto the plane perpendicular to the rod. Report greatest opposition between thumb and a finger. Sample rest plus four phases of Walk, Reach, Offer dispatch, and Pose · Present dispatch. Crossing counts depend on mesh tessellation and are not grasp force or evidence of a contact between keyed samples.",
